<article class="container my-5">
  <div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-8">
      <header class="text-center mb-5">
        <span class="badge rounded-pill bg-success-subtle text-success mb-3 px-3 py-2">
          <i class="bi bi-recycle me-1"></i>Bulky e-waste guide
        </span>
        <h1 class="display-4 mb-3 text-success lh-sm">How to Dispose of Big Electronic Items</h1>
        <p class="lead text-muted mb-4">Safe, convenient ways to recycle large household appliances in Singapore</p>
        <div class="border-bottom border-success border-3 mx-auto" style="width: 60px;"></div>
      </header>

      <div class="alert alert-success border-start border-success border-4 mb-5" role="alert">
        <h2 class="h5 alert-heading"><i class="bi bi-info-circle-fill me-2"></i>Do not leave bulky e-waste beside a recycling bin</h2>
        <p class="mb-0">Collection bins are intended only for items that fit safely through their openings. Large appliances need a take-back, collection, or depot service.</p>
      </div>

      <section class="mb-5">
        <h2 class="h3 text-success mb-4">What counts as bulky e-waste?</h2>
        <p class="lh-lg">Large household appliances are too large or heavy for normal e-waste bins and can contain materials that require specialist handling.</p>
        <div class="row g-3 mt-2">
          <div class="col-sm-6">
            <div class="card h-100 border-0 bg-light">
              <div class="card-body">
                <h3 class="h6 text-success"><i class="bi bi-snow me-2"></i>Cooling appliances</h3>
                <p class="mb-0 text-muted">Refrigerators and air-conditioners</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-sm-6">
            <div class="card h-100 border-0 bg-light">
              <div class="card-body">
                <h3 class="h6 text-success"><i class="bi bi-water me-2"></i>Laundry appliances</h3>
                <p class="mb-0 text-muted">Washing machines and clothes dryers</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-sm-6">
            <div class="card h-100 border-0 bg-light">
              <div class="card-body">
                <h3 class="h6 text-success"><i class="bi bi-tv me-2"></i>Large displays</h3>
                <p class="mb-0 text-muted">Televisions and desktop monitors</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-sm-6">
            <div class="card h-100 border-0 bg-light">
              <div class="card-body">
                <h3 class="h6 text-success"><i class="bi bi-pc-display me-2"></i>All-in-one computers</h3>
                <p class="mb-0 text-muted">Desktop computers with the display and computer in one unit</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-5">
        <h2 class="h3 text-success mb-4">Choose the right disposal method</h2>
        <div class="d-flex gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="badge bg-success rounded-circle d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center flex-shrink-0" style="width: 34px; height: 34px;">1</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="h5 mb-2">Reuse or repair it first</h3>
            <p class="mb-0 lh-lg">If the appliance still works, consider repairing, donating, or reselling it. Extending its useful life avoids waste and preserves the energy and materials already used to make it.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="d-flex gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="badge bg-success rounded-circle d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center flex-shrink-0" style="width: 34px; height: 34px;">2</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="h5 mb-2">Ask the retailer for one-for-one take-back</h3>
            <p class="mb-0 lh-lg">When a new regulated product is delivered, the retailer must offer free take-back of an unwanted product of the same type. Tell the retailer in advance so collection can be coordinated with delivery.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="d-flex gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="badge bg-success rounded-circle d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center flex-shrink-0" style="width: 34px; height: 34px;">3</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="h5 mb-2">Arrange a collection</h3>
            <p class="mb-0 lh-lg">HDB residents can contact their Town Council about bulky-item removal. Residential users can also book ALBA doorstep collection, or use an announced collection drive. Eligibility and charges depend on the item and service.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="d-flex gap-3">
          <span class="badge bg-success rounded-circle d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center flex-shrink-0" style="width: 34px; height: 34px;">4</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="h5 mb-2">Use an authorised drop-off point</h3>
            <p class="mb-0 lh-lg">Regulated consumer e-waste may be taken to ALBA's depot or a collection drive. Check what the location accepts before transporting the item.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-5">
        <h2 class="h3 text-success mb-4">Prepare the item safely</h2>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush border rounded">
          <li class="list-group-item py-3"><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success me-2"></i>Back up anything you need, then sign out and erase personal data from smart devices.</li>
          <li class="list-group-item py-3"><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success me-2"></i>Switch off and unplug the appliance. Secure loose cables, doors, trays, and removable parts.</li>
          <li class="list-group-item py-3"><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-success me-2"></i>Empty and clean refrigerators, washers, and dryers before the collection date.</li>
          <li class="list-group-item py-3"><i class="bi bi-x-circle-fill text-danger me-2"></i>Do not cut refrigerant lines, dismantle the appliance, or remove built-in batteries yourself.</li>
          <li class="list-group-item py-3"><i class="bi bi-x-circle-fill text-danger me-2"></i>Do not move a very heavy item alone. Tell the collector about stairs, access limits, or damage when booking.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-success-subtle rounded-3 p-4 p-md-5 text-center mb-5">
        <h2 class="h3 text-success mb-3">Need someone to collect it?</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">Compare the available collection routes and get your appliance ready for pickup.</p>
        <a href="/articles/pickup-service" class="btn btn-success btn-lg">
          View Pickup Options <i class="bi bi-arrow-right ms-1"></i>
        </a>
      </section>

      <section class="border-top pt-4 mb-4">
        <h2 class="h5 text-success mb-3">Official resources</h2>
        <p class="small text-muted mb-2">Service details can change. Confirm acceptance, fees, and collection requirements before disposal.</p>
        <a href="https://www.nea.gov.sg/our-services/waste-management/3r-programmes-and-resources/e-waste-management/where-to-recycle-e-waste" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="me-3">NEA: Where to recycle e-waste <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right small"></i></a>
        <a href="https://alba-ewaste.sg/doorstep-collection/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ALBA: Doorstep collection <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right small"></i></a>
      </section>

      <footer class="border-top pt-4 mt-5 d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row justify-content-between align-items-sm-center gap-3">
        <p class="text-muted mb-0"><small><i class="bi bi-calendar3 me-1"></i>Information checked: July 2026</small></p>
        <a href="/articles" class="btn btn-outline-success btn-sm"><i class="bi bi-arrow-left me-1"></i>Back to Articles</a>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
